               <msContents>
                  <summary>Folios 1-5  contain fragments of sūrat al-Ḥaǧǧ and sūrat al-Anbiyā'. Folios 2-5 are bound back to front.</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i0">
                     <locus from="7v" to="26v">7v-26v</locus>
                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s23IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#7v">-7v</locus>قال الم اقل لك إنك لن تستطيع معي صبرا , قال إن سألتك عن شي</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#26v">-26v</locus>فستعلمون من اصحاب الصراط السوي ومن اهتدى</explicit>
                     <note>18:75-20:135. Red dots as verse markers. Interlinear taǧwīd markers in red. Headings of sūras in red. Some additions and corrections in the margins. Catchwords difficult to read due to close binding.</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
